{"type":"message","id":"18c698d1","parentId":"8d0d1b30","timestamp":"2026-07-28T01:00:00.484Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:rules-refresh-daily Cursor协作规则刷新] 【每日规则刷新】请记住以下 Cursor 协作规则（每天提醒一次）：\n\n1. 当用户要求让 Cursor 做某件事时，必须执行：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --title \"任务标题\" --instructions \"具体指令\" --submitted-by \"OpenClaw\" --notify\n\n2. 当用户回复了 Cursor 发来的飞书确认消息时，必须执行：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\confirm_write.py\" --task-id \"task_id\" --decision auto --reply \"用户回复原文\"\n\n3. 查看当前 Cursor 任务队列：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --list\n\n4. 查看已完成任务结果：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --results\n\n以上规则已写入 AGENTS.md，请确认记住。无需回复，静默确认即可。\nCurrent time: Tuesday, July 28th, 2026 — 09:00 (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-07-28 01:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1785200400479}}
{"type":"message","id":"a12a2063","parentId":"18c698d1","timestamp":"2026-07-28T01:00:11.566Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a cron-triggered system event that asks me to remember the Cursor collaboration rules. The task says \"无需回复，静默确认即可\" (no reply needed, just silently confirm). So I should just acknowledge internally but not send any response since this is a system event being injected.\n\nActually, looking at the instructions more carefully - it says to return summary as plain text and it will be delivered automatically. But also says \"无需回复，静默确认即可\" (no reply needed, silently confirm). \n\nI think the right approach is to just silently process this and not send any message. The cron task is just to remind me of the rules, not to send any notification anywhere. The \"return your summary as plain text\" might refer to what the cron job expects, but given the explicit \"无需回复\", I should not respond.\n\nWait, actually I need to think about this more carefully. This is a cron job that runs. It says \"Return your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically.\" But it also says \"无需回复，静默确认即可\" which means I should just silently confirm.\n\nThe task is essentially a self-reminder system event. Since it says to return summary, maybe I should just return a brief acknowledgment. But the \"静默确认\" instruction is quite clear. I'll just process it and not respond."},{"type":"text","text":"已收到静默确认。Cursor 协作规则已记住：\n\n1. 用户要求 Cursor 做事 → `submit_task.py --title ... --instructions ... --notify`\n2. 用户回复 Cursor 确认消息 → `confirm_write.py --task-id ... --decision auto --reply ...`\n3. 查看任务队列 → `submit_task.py --list`\n4. 查看已完成结果 → `submit_task.py --results`"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1785200400483}}
